roblem."], [675.5, "s", "He needed to find the real cause, the true cause, the deep cause."], [679.9, "s", "So AJ decided to search for the root cause."], [683.2, "q", "And what was the root cause?"], [685.2, "a", "Well the root cause was his mind."], [687.4, "s", "The root cause was his nervousness, his craziness, his anxious..."], [692.2, "s", "Feelings all the time."], [694.3, "s", "The root cause was his mind."], [696.3, "s", "So AJ realized he needed to cultivate a peaceful mind."], [700.4, "s", "He decided to take care of his mind."], [702.3, "s", "He decided to let his mind grow more peaceful."], [706.3, "s", "He took care of his mind every day."], [708.5, "s", "How did he cultivate a peaceful mind?"], [711.3, "s", "Did he read?"], [712.3, "q", "Is that how he cultivated a peaceful mind?"], [714.8, "a", "No."], [715.5, "s", "He cultivated a peaceful mind by meditating every day."], [720.2, "s", "Breathing in and breathing out, sitting with his eyes closed."], [724.7, "s", "Did this work?"], [725.9, "q", "Did he achieve success?"], [727.9, "a", "Yes he did."], [729.0, "s", "Every day his mind became less distracted."], [733.0, "s", "Less distracted."], [734.8, "s", "More calm."], [738.2, "s", "He cultivated a peaceful mind."], [740.8, "s", "His mind was no longer distracted."], [742.5, "s", "It did not jump from one thought to another quickly."], [745.8, "s", "Instead it was focused."], [748.2, "q", "In the end, what did AJ do?"], [749.9, "a", "Well, in the end, he cut off all his hair."], [752.8, "s", "He moved to a mountain."], [754.7, "s", "He found a cave, and he lived in the cave for the rest of his life."], [759.3, "s", "This is the end of the story."], [761.3, "s", "When you finish listening to this a few times, please write about this topic and use some of this vocabulary in the forums."], [769.2, "s", "Okay?"], [769.9, "s", "I will see you next time."], [771.0, "s", "Bye-bye."]]}]$j$::jsonb,
