ize how strong he is now."], [726.9, "s", "So he's saying, compare yourself: now you are strong, and think of yourself before, you were weak, right?"], [733.5, "s", "Counterpose your weak self and your strong self."], [736.4, "s", "Realize you are stronger now."], [738.3, "s", "So he says counter pose your old self and your new self."], [741.1, "s", "He says then you were weak now you are strong."], [745.4, "s", "AJ says yes master I am strong I am now ready to destroy my evil English class."], [754.8, "s", "As AJ walks out the door the master yells keep to your ninja methods and destroy them all."], [763.4, "q", "Does he want AJ to stay with his ninja methods?"], [768.5, "a", "Yes, that's right, he wants him to stay with his ninja methods."], [772.9, "s", "He wants him to use only the ninja methods, right?"], [776.6, "s", "Continue with the ninja methods, continue with the ninja training."], [780.3, "s", "So he says, keep to your ninja methods, don't try other things, don't do other things."], [786.2, "s", "Remember your ninja methods, keep to your ninja methods, stay with them."], [790.7, "s", "So the master yells, keep to your ninja methods."], [794.0, "q", "Does he want AJ to keep to his karate methods?"], [797.7, "a", "No, he did not learn karate."], [799.9, "s", "He did not say keep to your karate methods, he said keep to your ninja methods."], [805.8, "q", "What kind of methods should A.J. keep to?"], [810.4, "a", "Well, he should keep to his ninja methods, right?"], [813.3, "s", "Keep to your ninja methods, stay with your ninja methods, use only those."], [818.0, "s", "So the master yells keep to your ninja methods and destroy them all."], [824.2, "s", "Alright, one more time."], [826.7, "s", "This time I'm going to pause after the key phrases with the new vocabulary."], [832.5, "s", "Repeat those phrases after me, don't just repeat."], [836.2, "s", "Copy my intonation when I go up and when I go down, right?"], [840.1, "s", "Copy it very carefully, try to so