acher says no, that is not the means of ninja fighting today."], [485.3, "s", "He says contemporary American ninjas use guns."], [492.1, "q", "Do old ninjas in the past 200 years ago did they use guns?"], [498.4, "a", "No, they did not."], [500.7, "s", "Old ninjas, they don't use guns."], [504.2, "s", "Contemporary ninjas use guns, modern ninjas use guns, today, this time in history."], [511.7, "s", "Contemporary ninjas use guns."], [514.1, "q", "Do contemporary Japanese ninjas use guns?"], [517.5, "a", "No, in fact they don't."], [520.4, "s", "They still like tradition, the Japanese ninjas."], [524.5, "s", "Contemporary American Ninjas use guns."], [529.1, "s", "Contemporary Japanese Ninjas do not."], [532.5, "q", "Is A.J. learning from a contemporary American Ninja?"], [538.6, "a", "Yes, in fact, he is."], [539.7, "s", "He is learning from a contemporary American Ninja."], [542.7, "s", "He's learning from a modern American Ninja, not an old, traditional one."], [548.1, "s", "He's learning from a contemporary American Ninja."], [550.6, "q", "What weapon do contemporary American ninjas use?"], [558.5, "a", "Well, they use guns, right?"], [560.3, "s", "Contemporary American ninjas use guns."], [562.1, "s", "That's their weapon."], [563.3, "s", "That's how they kill people, usually."], [565.6, "s", "Their guns and their hands and their feet."], [569.1, "s", "So contemporary American ninjas use guns."], [572.5, "s", "Then the master begins to teach AJ how to fight and how to use guns like a ninja."], [578.3, "s", "When they're training, when they're practicing, he yells at AJ, don't stand rigidly, make your body soft and flexible."], [587.8, "q", "Does he want AJ to stand very rigidly, very hard?"], [592.8, "a", "No, he wants AJ to have a soft body, so he can move very easily."], [600.4, "s", "He does not want AJ to stand rigidly."], [604.4, "q", "Does he want AJ to fight rigidly, with very hard, strong muscles?"], [610.4, "a", "No, he doesn't want AJ to fight rigidly.