ter pose his old self and his new self?"], [723.1, "a", "Well he wants him to realize how strong he is now."], [726.9, "s", "So he's saying, compare yourself: now you are strong, and think of yourself before, you were weak, right?"], [733.5, "s", "Counterpose your weak self and your strong self."], [736.4, "s", "Realize you are stronger now."], [738.3, "s", "So he says counter pose your old self and your new self."], [741.1, "s", "He says then you were weak now you are strong."], [745.4, "s", "AJ says yes master I am strong I am now ready to destroy my evil English class."], [754.8, "s", "As AJ walks out the door the master yells keep to your ninja methods and destroy them all."], [763.4, "q", "Does he want AJ to stay with his ninja methods?"], [768.5, "a", "Yes, that's right, he wants him to stay with his ninja methods."], [772.9, "s", "He wants him to use only the ninja methods, right?"], [776.6, "s", "Continue with the ninja methods, continue with the ninja training."], [780.3, "s", "So he says, keep to your ninja methods, don't try other things, don't do other things."], [786.2, "s", "Remember your ninja methods, keep to your ninja methods, stay with them."], [790.7, "s", "So the master yells, keep to your ninja methods."], [794.0, "q", "Does he want AJ to keep to his karate methods?"], [797.7, "a", "No, he did not learn karate."], [799.9, "s", "He did not say keep to your karate methods, he said keep to your ninja methods."], [805.8, "q", "What kind of methods should A.J. keep to?"], [810.4, "a", "Well, he should keep to his ninja methods, right?"], [813.3, "s", "Keep to your ninja methods, stay with your ninja methods, use only those."], [818.0, "s", "So the master yells keep to your ninja methods and destroy them all."], [824.2, "s", "Alright, one more time."], [826.7, "s", "This time I'm going to pause after the key phrases with the new vocabulary."], [832.5, "s", "Repeat those phrases after me, don't just repeat."], [836.2, "s", "Copy my intonation when I go up and when I go down, right?"], [840.1, "s", "Copy it very carefully, try to sound exactly like me, here we go."], [845.4, "s", "One day AJ goes to English class, one student named Aki complains, AJ, your class sucks, it's boring."], [854.6, "s", "AJ is surprised, he asks the class, is this the prevailing opinion?"], [861.8, "s", "Is this the prevailing opinion?"], [866.3, "s", "Good."], [867.2, "s", "Do you all agree?"], [869.0, "s", "They all shout together, yes, you suck!"], [872.3, "s", "Then they attack AJ."], [874.1, "s", "They hit him and beat him."], [876.9, "s", "They throw him out of the room and shout, you are barred from this class, never come back!"], [885.2, "s", "Good."], [886.0, "s", "You are barred from this class, never come back."], [893.1, "s", "Good AJ is sad he decides to get revenge and fight again."], [898.3, "s", "So he joins a ninja school to learn how to fight."], [901.3, "s", "He says to the ninja teacher."], [903.0, "s", "I want to learn to kill someone with a knife and a sword."], [907.3, "s", "The teacher says, your conceptions of the means of ninja fighting are old and wrong."], [918.0, "s", "Your conceptions of the means of ninja fighting are old and wrong."], [925.8, "s", "That's difficult, right?"], [926.9, "s", "Your conceptions of the means of ninja fighting are old and wrong."], [929.6, "s", "He says, contemporary American ninjas use guns."], [936.4, "s", "Contemporary American ninjas use guns."], [942.3, "s", "Good."], [942.9, "s", "He then begins to teach A.J. how to fight and how to use guns like a ninja."], [947.4, "s", "He yells, don't stand rigidly."], [952.3, "s", "Don't stand rigidly."], [955.8, "s", "Good."], [956.4, "s", "Make your body soft and flexible."], [958.6, "s", "Every day A.J. practices."], [960.7, "s", "Finally he is ready."], [961.9, "s", "He is strong and dangerous."], [963.9, "s", "The teacher says, counterpose your old self to your new self."], [971.6, "s", "Counterpose your old self to your new self.