4, "s", "Rescuers discovered Buffy right away."], [2995.9, "s", "A plane took her to an emergency room at the hospital."], [3002.4, "s", "Two days later Buffy went back to the island."], [3008.0, "s", "Xander was gone."], [3011.3, "s", "Xander was gone."], [3014.6, "s", "He was one of the 17 vampire cows that Buffy lost."], [3022.1, "s", "Buffy cried and cried."], [3026.0, "s", "Buffy said, I owe my life to him after all."], [3031.4, "s", "He saved me."]]}]$j$::jsonb,
