't Brad Pitt that was happy it was you are very drunk and very happy."], [2562.2, "q", "Why are you happy?"], [2566.3, "a", "Because you're home because you're home and you're drunk you are very drunk and very happy."], [2578.2, "s", "You are very happy because you're home."], [2583.8, "s", "You have arrived at home."], [2588.1, "q", "Are you very sober and very happy?"], [2593.9, "a", "No, you aren't sober."], [2597.3, "s", "You're drunk."], [2598.9, "s", "You are very drunk and very happy."], [2603.2, "q", "Who's happy and drunk?"], [2606.8, "a", "You are."], [2608.5, "q", "Why are you happy?"], [2611.5, "a", "Because you're home."], [2614.4, "s", "Six hours later, you finally arrive home."], [2619.0, "s", "You are very drunk and very happy."], [2626.2, "s", "So, this is the end of Episode 2 to Movie Star."], [2630.6, "s", "Let's do the final read-through."], [2636.1, "s", "Movie star, one day you are walking on the street."], [2641.3, "s", "You bump into Brad Pitt."], [2644.5, "s", "He looks at you and says, wow you're amazing."], [2649.4, "s", "Wow you are amazing."], [2652.5, "s", "Come with me to Los Angeles."], [2655.4, "s", "I will make you a movie star."], [2659.4, "s", "You go to LA and become a famous movie star."], [2665.9, "s", "You are rich."], [2667.9, "s", "Everybody loves you."], [2670.5, "s", "But you have a problem."], [2673.3, "s", "You are lonely in LA."], [2676.6, "s", "You miss your friends, so you decide to fly home and visit your friends and family."], [2684.7, "s", "You get a first class ticket because you are rich."], [2688.9, "s", "However, when you get to the airport, your flight is delayed."], [2695.7, "s", "The ticket agent says, I'm sorry, your flight is delayed seven and a half hours."], [2703.2, "s", "You wait."], [2705.4, "s", "After seven and a half hours, an agent says, I'm sorry, but the flight has been canceled."], [2714.6, "s", "You are angry."], [2716.1, "s", "You yell at the agent I've been waiting seven and a half hours I'm tired and I'm pissed off I want another flight the."], [2730.2, "s", "The agent recognizes you because you are a famous movie star."], [2737.0, "s", "She says, I'm so sorry, we'll get you on another flight."], [2743.8, "s", "She looks on her computer and finds another flight in four hours."], [2751.2, "s", "She says, I have you booked on the next flight in four hours."], [2756.2, "s", "Here is your new boarding pass."], [2759.3, "s", "You take the ticket and wait in a bar."], [2762.4, "s", "You drink 62 beers and get very drunk."], [2768.8, "s", "Four hours later, you go to the gate to catch your flight."], [2772.9, "s", "Flight, but you are drunk, so you walk very slowly."], [2780.7, "s", "Because you walk so slowly, you're late and you miss your flight."], [2786.9, "s", "When you get to the gate, the plane is already leaving."], [2792.3, "s", "You yell, Damn it!"], [2794.7, "s", "I missed my flight!"], [2797.1, "s", "You are drunk and angry."], [2799.8, "s", "The agent is afraid."], [2803.1, "s", "She calls airport security."], [2806.6, "s", "26 security officers run to the gate."], [2809.9, "s", "They grab you and take you away."], [2813.2, "s", "However, one officer recognizes you."], [2817.6, "s", "He says, Wow, you're a famous movie star."], [2823.0, "s", "The officers are all very happy to meet you."], [2828.2, "s", "They say, we'll help you."], [2831.7, "s", "We have a police airplane and we can fly you home."], [2838.2, "s", "You are very happy."], [2841.3, "s", "All of you have a big party inside the police airplane."], [2856.5, "s", "Six."]]}]$j$::jsonb,
