500 TVs."], [364.8, "s", "How many cell phones 50."], [372.8, "s", "He wants to have 50 cell phones."], [376.6, "s", "He wants to have 500 TVs."], [381.3, "q", "And how many electric toothbrushes does he want to have?"], [389.6, "a", "30."], [390.5, "s", "He wants to have 30 electronic toothbrushes."], [394.4, "s", "He wants to have 50 cell phones."], [397.0, "s", "He wants to have 500 TVs."], [401.5, "s", "Who?"], [402.3, "q", "Who wants to have all of these?"], [407.1, "a", "Jimbo the dog wants to have all of these."], [413.7, "q", "Who is the dog's best friend?"], [419.2, "a", "Cat, right?"], [421.4, "s", "Cat is the dog's best friend."], [423.6, "q", "And what is the cat's name?"], [432.3, "a", "The cat's name is Neko."], [435.7, "s", "Neko the cat."], [439.4, "q", "Does Neko like gadgets?"], [443.9, "a", "No, she doesn't."], [446.0, "s", "She doesn't like gadgets."], [448.0, "q", "Who likes gadgets?"], [451.1, "a", "Jimbo."], [451.7, "s", "Jimbo likes gadgets."], [454.4, "s", "Neko doesn't like gadgets."], [459.8, "q", "Who has a problem?"], [463.3, "a", "Jimbo."], [465.2, "s", "Jimbo has a problem."], [468.5, "q", "What is his problem?"], [473.5, "a", "Well, Jimbo's problem is that he's in debt."], [480.1, "s", "To be in debt means you have debt."], [484.2, "s", "It means you owe money."], [488.0, "s", "So he's in debt, he owes money."], [492.0, "s", "Is Neko in debt?"], [495.1, "q", "Or is Jimbo in debt?"], [498.6, "a", "Well, Neko's not in debt."], [501.5, "s", "Jimbo is in debt."], [505.5, "s", "Is Jimbo in debt a little bit?"], [508.6, "q", "Or a lot?"], [512.4, "a", "Oh, a lot."], [513.4, "s", "He's in debt a lot."], [515.8, "s", "He owes $58,000."], [523.4, "q", "What is Jimbo's problem?"], [525.3, "a", "Well, Jimbo's problem is that he's in debt."], [533.2, "s", "Jimbo is in debt."], [534.7, "s", "He owes $58,000."], [538.3, "q", "What is Neko's problem?"], [544.2, "a", "Neko doesn't have a problem."], [546.7, "s", "Neko is happy."], [548.5, "s", "Neko'