ave three qualities?"], [200.1, "a", "Yes."], [201.0, "s", "They had three qualities they possessed three qualities possessed means had."], [212.4, "q", "Who had these three qualities?"], [220.3, "a", "Ah well, people born into poverty who became rich."], [226.6, "s", "People born into poverty who became wealthy."], [231.2, "s", "Rich."], [232.8, "s", "Possessed three similar qualities these."], [239.3, "s", "Qualities were number one they maintained a long-term vision."], [247.9, "q", "Who maintained a long-term vision?"], [254.2, "a", "Well people born into poverty who later became rich maintained a long-term vision."], [265.1, "s", "Did they have a future goal a future dream."], [274.6, "s", "Yes, they all had a future dream."], [278.8, "s", "When they were poor, they had a dream."], [283.4, "s", "They had a vision."], [285.4, "s", "They had a goal to be wealthy."], [292.4, "q", "So, did they have a long-term vision or a short-term vision?"], [300.6, "a", "They had a long-term vision."], [302.6, "s", "It means far in the future."], [305.0, "s", "They had a far future vision."], [312.0, "q", "Did they have a vision?"], [315.3, "a", "Yes they did, they had a vision."], [318.0, "q", "What was their vision?"], [323.5, "a", "Well, their vision was to be wealthy."], [326.8, "s", "They had a dream to be wealthy in the future, in the far future."], [332.8, "s", "They maintained, they kept a long-term vision, a long-term dream."], [340.8, "q", "Who kept a long-term vision?"], [345.1, "a", "Well, people born into poverty who later became rich."], [352.0, "s", "They had another quality, quality number two."], [355.2, "s", "They believed in delayed gratification."], [362.1, "s", "Did they want pleasure?"], [364.5, "q", "Did they want total happiness now no?"], [371.3, "a", "They did not want gratification now they believed in delayed gratification they believed in waiting for pleasure did."], [387.1, "s", "They believe in delayed gratification or did they believe in instant 