 will make 20 or 30% interest."], [902.0, "s", "But you need to get a good return on investment."], [911.9, "q", "Do you need a good return on investment, or do you need a bad return on investment?"], [921.0, "a", "You need a good return on investment."], [926.4, "q", "You need a good what?"], [930.3, "a", "You need a good return on investment."], [936.5, "q", "Do you need to make more money than you invest?"], [944.1, "a", "Yes."], [945.5, "s", "You need to make more money than you invest."], [948.4, "s", "You need to have a good return on investment."], [954.5, "s", "If you invest one dollar and make ten dollars more is that a good return on investment."], [966.5, "s", "Oh yes it's a very good it's excellent."], [971.7, "s", "It's an excellent return on investment so."], [978.9, "s", "You want a good return on investment you want to make much more money than you spend much more money than you invest you."], [993.4, "s", "Can focus your investing in many ways."], [998.2, "s", "You can invest in many ways."], [1001.0, "s", "You can create a successful small business."], [1007.0, "s", "You can buy stocks."], [1011.1, "s", "And you can buy real estate."], [1016.8, "s", "Can you buy land as an investment?"], [1028.0, "q", "Yes, you buy buildings as an investment?"], [1031.7, "a", "Yes, you can buy buildings as an investment."], [1034.8, "s", "You can buy real estate as an investment."], [1041.5, "q", "What are buildings and land called in business?"], [1049.4, "a", "Real estate."], [1050.9, "s", "Buildings and land are called real estate in business."], [1058.0, "q", "Can you invest in real estate yes?"], [1063.2, "a", "You can invest in real estate you can buy land and buildings and sell them later for more money you can invest in real estate."], [1078.7, "s", "Okay that is the end of the mini-story listen to it every day for seven days ten days maybe two weeks you next time bye."]]}]$j$::jsonb,
