are already doing remarkable things."], [854.2, "q", "So do you need flesh and blood people or imaginary people?"], [860.1, "a", "Not real people."], [862.7, "s", "Well, you need flesh and blood people."], [864.5, "s", "You need real people."], [866.4, "s", "Not a movie character."], [868.5, "s", "Not someone in a book."], [871.6, "s", "Not an actor."], [872.8, "s", "You need real, flesh-and-blood people who are already doing remarkable things; you need real people."], [883.6, "q", "So, do you need flesh-and-blood people?"], [887.9, "a", "Yes, you do; you need flesh-and-blood, real people."], [893.7, "s", "All right now when you do demos."], [897.9, "s", "Do you do a permanent,?"], [900.8, "q", "Perfect project?"], [906.1, "a", "No."], [907.5, "s", "A demo is not a permanent, perfect project."], [910.8, "s", "A demo is a trial project."], [915.2, "q", "Is it a permanent, perfect project or a trial project?"], [921.2, "a", "A trial project."], [922.7, "s", "A demo is a trial project."], [924.8, "s", "It's a fast, cheap, simple version of a product or service."], [931.6, "q", "So is a trial project, is it fast and cheap, or slow and expensive?"], [940.0, "a", "Well a trial project is fast and cheap."], [944.5, "s", "A demo is fast and cheap."], [950.4, "s", "So you do demos, they're not perfect."], [952.9, "s", "They're fast, they're cheap, they're simple versions of a product or service, a trial project, a demo."], [960.5, "s", "Now, of course, eventually, you improve your demo."], [965.6, "s", "And eventually, it evolves into a complete successful product or service."], [973.4, "q", "Does your demo stay the same, or does it evolve?"], [982.7, "a", "Well, it evolves."], [983.6, "s", "It changes it gets better and better little by little does your demo?"], [990.9, "s", "Improve little by little or Does it stay the same it improves little by little it evolves?"], [1002.8, "q", "What evolves?"], [1007.4, "a", "Your demo your demo."], [1010.1, "s", "Evolves or the demo evolves the demo."], [1014.1, "s", "Evolves the demo gets better and better and better."], [1020.7, "q", "Does it evolve or is it always the same?"], [1026.9, "a", "It evolves."], [1028.0, "s", "It changes."], [1028.7, "s", "It grows."], [1029.4, "s", "It gets better and better and better."], [1033.1, "s", "Okay, that is the end of the mini-story for The Way."], [1037.8, "s", "Listen to it a few times and then listen to the commentary."]]}]$j$::jsonb,
